 "name": "seal_costume_prone",
 "description": "Doug's grey seal suit worn lying flat on the ice, drawn SIDE-ON like ringed_seal (mirrored: hood/head end at the left, tail at the right): plump tapered grey #8a8f96 body, darker back with pale ring spots, pale belly on the ice, small front flipper, paired hind flippers past his feet, a zipper down the back seam, and a grey hood band round the back and chin of his head with whisker pads + whiskers either side of the face. Head, face and red cap stay visible. Pairs with Doug pose `on_back`: place it AFTER Doug at x = Doug x + 30*scale, same y and scale, rotate -90 (the drawing is stored pre-rotated so it slots into the old seal_costume prone placement). Covers about 540x170 on screen at scale 1 (Doug-frame x -314..292, y -96..72). The upright seal_costume is unchanged.",
